# Never commit distributable zips or the dead, orphaned microfyxd
# standalone monorepo -- it has its own broken build (no tsconfig in
# apps/runtime) and has caused real Railway deploy failures when
# accidentally included in a repo/build root.
*.zip
microfyxd/

# Firebase was removed (backend is Supabase-only); block accidental
# recommits of the old client config.
firebase-applet-config.json
